READING
  PINNED is the only verdict that supports 'this region compares cost
  at a fixed answer' from the region's own code. The consent flag is
  orthogonal: satfold consents AND pins, so it is answer-equivalent.
  UNPINNED and NO ORACLE AT ALL regions have arms whose agreement is
  asserted nowhere in this repository. Whether they in fact agree is a
  separate measurement, taken for two of them in p2, p3 and p4.
